msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "It will rain tomorrow. Or it won't. One of those two. You will"
msgstr "내일 비가 올 거야. 아니면 안 오거나. 둘 중 하나지. 넌 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:549
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Mostly just seeing death in your future, sorry. You'll most likely"
msgstr "네 미래엔 주로 죽음이 보이네. 미안. 아마 넌 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The prophesies speak of you! They state you will"
msgstr "예언에서 널 언급했어! 거기 따르면 넌 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:551
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "You shall make it to Canada! It is foreseen! Just kidding, you'll"
msgstr "캐나다에 닿으리라! 예견되었노라! 농담이고, 넌 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:556
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "YOUR FORTUNE"
msgstr "당신의 운세"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:562
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " resolves to defy fate!"
msgstr "은(는) 운명에 맞서기로 결심한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:563
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " - MAX HEALTH AND LUCK INCREASED!"
msgstr " - 최대 체력과 행운 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:569
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The tarot reading reveals amazing personal truths about "
msgstr "타로 점괘가 놀라운 내면의 진실을 밝혀 준다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:578
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the tarot reading? It will reveal a lot about them."
msgstr "누가 타로 점을 볼까? 그 사람에 관해 많은 것을 알 수 있을 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:583
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" hires the wizard!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 마법사를 고용한다!\r\n"
"\t"

