msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for the wizard?"
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t마법사를 영입하려면 누구를 내보낼까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:598
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The Wizard"
msgstr "마법사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:600
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"This guy looks like he might be a wizard.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 사람은 마법사처럼 보인다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:601
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"I'm a wizard! I can foresee your future, or reveal hidden truths with the "
"power of the tarot!"
msgstr "난 마법사야! 미래를 내다보거나 타로의 힘으로 숨은 진실을 밝힐 수 있지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:604
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Free fortune: You're going to starve! Then you'll"
msgstr "공짜 운세다! 넌 굶게 될 거야! 그리고 넌 "

