msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Cool, a free fortune!"
msgstr "와, 공짜 운세!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:607
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Give nothing to this FRAUD"
msgstr "이 사기꾼에게 아무것도 주지 않기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:609
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Get fortune - 1 food"
msgstr "운세 보기 - 식량 1"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:613
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Get a tarot reading - 5 food"
msgstr "타로 점 보기 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:616
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Recruit wizard - 20 food"
msgstr "마법사 영입 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:634
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " reads "
msgstr "은(는) 읽는다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:634 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:668
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "THE ULTIMATE GUIDE TO DOGS"
msgstr "개에 대한 궁극의 안내서"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:634
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ". This massive book has every page filled with dog knowledge."
msgstr ". 이 거대한 책은 모든 페이지가 개에 관한 지식으로 가득하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:635 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:643
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " gains the perk: "
msgstr "가 얻은 특전: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:635
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "FRIEND OF DOG!"
msgstr "개의 친구!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:642
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " buys "
msgstr "은(는) 산다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:642 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "P.L. PLARKEN'S MAP ATLAS"
msgstr "P.L. 플라켄의 지도책"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:642
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
". It contains maps of every street from here to Canada. This will be "
"extremely valuable."
msgstr ". 여기서 캐나다까지 모든 거리의 지도가 들어 있다. 엄청나게 유용할 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:643
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "EXPLORER!"
msgstr "탐험가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:649
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " - 5 food"
msgstr " - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:653
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Rare Books"
msgstr "희귀 서적"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:655
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"This bookish trader talks about how she's selling valuable rare books.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"책벌레 같은 상인이 값진 희귀 서적을 팔고 있다고 말한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:656
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"Please don't mess with the display books! They're fake, I put them down to "
"confuse book thieves."
msgstr "전시용 책은 건드리지 마! 다 가짜야. 책 도둑을 속이려고 놓아뒀지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:659
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "You don't have enough food to buy any of the good books!"
msgstr "좋은 책을 살 식량이 부족해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:660
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "I wanted those books"
msgstr "그 책들 갖고 싶었는데"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:662
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Books are for nerds"
msgstr "책은 샌님들이나 보는 거지"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:668 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " - 15 food"
msgstr " - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:680
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys the giant sword.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 거대한 검을 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:681
