msgid "You will not regret the purchase of a Cold Steel sword!"
msgstr "콜드 스틸 검을 산 걸 후회하지 않을 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:688
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"He thought you'd never ask.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"언제 부탁하나 기다렸다고 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:689
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " temporarily recruits "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:689
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" so that he can provide a live demonstration.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"을(를) 시범을 보기 위해 잠시 영입한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:690
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "You'll be amazed by the power of the Cold Steel Greatsword!"
msgstr "콜드 스틸 대검의 위력에 깜짝 놀랄 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:692
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room?"
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t자리를 만들려면 누구를 내보낼까?"

