msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Your group is full. If you ask for the demo, "
msgstr "일행이 꽉 찼다. 시범을 부탁하려면 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:702
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"you will have to choose a team member to boot from the group!\r\n"
"\tYou will then gain a temporary recruit for the next location."
msgstr ""
"동료 하나를 내보내야 한다!\r\n"
"\t다음 장소에서 함께할 임시 동료를 얻게 된다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:704
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Cancel the demo"
msgstr "시범 취소하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:705
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Ditch someone for demo"
msgstr "동료 내보내고 시범 보기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:709
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Cold Steel Knives"
msgstr "콜드 스틸 나이브스"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:711
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"I'm selling the finest weapon you'll ever see, before or after the zombie apocalypse.\r\n"
"\t\tIt's the Cold Steel Greatsword from Cold Steel Knives! Only 45 food!"
msgstr ""
"좀비 종말 전후를 통틀어 최고의 무기를 팔고 있어.\r\n"
"\t\t콜드 스틸 나이브스의 콜드 스틸 대검이야! 식량 45면 돼!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:714
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "I'm not good enough for this sword "
msgstr "이 검을 쓰기엔 내 실력이 부족해 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:716
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Buy the Greatsword - 45 food"
msgstr "대검 사기 - 식량 45"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:719 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:721
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Ask for a demo"
msgstr "시범 부탁하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:733
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " buys the "
msgstr "은(는) 산다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:733
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"SKULL HAMMER.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"해골 망치를.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:734
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Beholdeth the incredible destructive power of my spare SKULL HAMMER."
msgstr "여분의 해골 망치가 지닌 놀라운 파괴력을 보라."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:739
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys the skeleton's shortsword!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 해골의 단검을 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:740
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"This gladius is a great sword, yet I never liked it becauseth it's not skull"
" themed."
msgstr "훌륭한 글라디우스이나, 해골 문양이 없어 내 취향이 아니었노라."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:745
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys five Bomb Skulls!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 해골 폭탄 다섯 개를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:746
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "These skulls art enchanted with devastating SKULL POWER!"
msgstr "이 해골들에는 파괴적인 해골의 힘이 깃들어 있노라!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:751
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" asks the skeleton why it needs food.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 해골에게 왜 식량이 필요한지 묻는다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:752
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Because I eat it, you dinguseth!"
msgstr "먹으려고지, 이 얼간아!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:758
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " farts on the skeleton knight's bone pile."
msgstr "은(는) 해골 기사의 뼈 더미에 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:760
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " tells the skeletal knight to "
msgstr "은(는) 해골 기사에게 말한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:760
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "COOL IT."
msgstr "진정해."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:763
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"His skull makes rapid creaking noises. Laughter?\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"해골에서 빠르게 삐걱대는 소리가 난다. 웃는 건가?\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:764
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "I haven't heard a jape like that in ten centuries!"
msgstr "천 년 만에 듣는 재밌는 농담이로다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:771
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "He insists on joining. Who would you like to replace to make room for "
msgstr "그가 합류하겠다고 우긴다. 자리를 만들려면 누구를 내보낼까? 영입할 사람: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:777
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "YOU COOLETH IT! YOU COOLETH IT!!"
msgstr "그대나 진정하거라! 그대나 진정하거라!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:777
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe heavily armed knight threatens to send "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t중무장한 기사가 위협한다. 보내 주겠다며 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:778
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " to the "
msgstr "을(를) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:778
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "BONE ZONE"
msgstr "뼈다귀 지대로"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Skeleton Knight"
msgstr "해골 기사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:786
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"It's an animated skeleton, wearing plate armor.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"판금 갑옷을 입은 움직이는 해골이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:787
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"I also hate zombies. They're coated in skin and flesh. It's disgusting!"
msgstr "나도 좀비를 증오한다. 피부와 살로 뒤덮여 있지. 역겨운 것들!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:789
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "I'll sell you some of my spare weapons, if it pleaseth you."
msgstr "원한다면 여분의 무기를 팔겠노라."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:791
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "That's all I can spareth! Have fun with your crusade."
msgstr "팔 수 있는 건 그게 전부로다! 성전을 즐기거라."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:794 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:889
#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:933
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "괜찮아"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:796
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " tells him to COOL IT"
msgstr "은(는) 그에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Ask why he needs food"
msgstr "왜 식량이 필요한지 묻기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:802
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Skull Hammer for 25 food"
msgstr "해골 망치 - 식량 25"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:805
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Gladius for 15 food"
msgstr "글라디우스 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:808
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "5 Bomb Skulls for 5 food"
msgstr "해골 폭탄 5개 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:820
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " jams food into the sleeping person's face."
msgstr "은(는) 잠자는 사람의 입에 식량을 쑤셔 넣는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " starts to understand "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " perfect zen tranquility, and learns the "
msgstr " 완벽한 평온을 이해하고 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "SOUND SLEEPER"
msgstr "꿀잠러"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " ability!"
msgstr " 능력을 배운다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:826
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Someone notices that "
msgstr "누군가 눈치챈다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:826
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" has been jamming large amounts of food into a sleeping person's mouth."
msgstr "이(가) 잠자는 사람의 입에 엄청난 식량을 쑤셔 넣고 있었다는 걸."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:827
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "HEY! YOU GET OUT OF THIS CAMP RIGHT NOW!"
msgstr "야! 너 당장 이 야영지에서 나가!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:828
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " runs away, fleeing from the trader camp!"
msgstr "은(는) 상인 야영지에서 도망친다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:831
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " talks nonsense in "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:831
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" sleep.\r\n"
"\t\tOr at least it sounds like nonsense, at first. "
msgstr ""
" 잠결에 헛소리를 늘어놓는다.\r\n"
"\t\t적어도 처음에는 헛소리처럼 들렸다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:832
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " thinks about it and realizes it's valuable knowledge."
msgstr "은(는) 곰곰이 생각한 끝에 값진 지식이라는 걸 깨닫는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:838
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Sleeping Trader"
msgstr "잠자는 상인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:840
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"This person is asleep. How could they sleep so soundly in the middle of the "
"zombocalypse? Right on the ground, no less."
msgstr "이 사람은 잠들어 있다. 좀비 종말 한복판에서 어떻게 저렇게 푹 잘까? 그것도 맨바닥에서."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:841
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " must have it all figured out."
msgstr "는 뭔가 깨달은 모양이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:843
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "WARNING: Jamming 4 more food in "
msgstr "경고: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:843
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " mouth will get you in trouble, but will also give "
msgstr " 입에 식량을 4개 더 넣으면 곤경에 처하지만, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:843
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " a new ability!"
msgstr "에게 새 능력이 생긴다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:847
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:847
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " alone"
msgstr "을(를) 내버려두기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:849
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ": Feed "
msgstr "의 선택: 먹이기 - "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:858
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys up a half dozen eggs. Zombies beware!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 달걀 여섯 개를 산다. 좀비들, 각오해라!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:859
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "BAKKAAAAAAAAAAAAW!"
msgstr "꼬꼬꼬꼬꼬꼬댁!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:864
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys a few eggs, adding to the egg arsenal.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 달걀 몇 개를 사서 달걀 무기고에 추가한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:865
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "BAKAAAAW!"
msgstr "꼬꼬꼬댁!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:870
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys up a single precious egg.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 귀중한 달걀 하나를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:871
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "BAWK!"
msgstr "꼬댁!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:876
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Free Range Chicken"
msgstr "방목한 닭"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:878
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"This chicken has opened up a business for itself!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 닭이 사업을 차렸다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:879
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "BAKAW!"
msgstr "꼬꼬댁!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:881
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The chicken has run out of eggs!"
msgstr "닭의 달걀이 떨어졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:885
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The chicken takes pity on you and gives you a free egg."
msgstr "닭이 일행을 불쌍히 여겨 달걀 하나를 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:888
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "It is selling very fresh eggs! 1 egg per 1 food."
msgstr "아주 신선한 달걀을 판다! 식량 1개에 달걀 1개."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:891
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Buy 6 Eggs"
msgstr "달걀 6개 사기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:894
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Buy 3 Eggs"
msgstr "달걀 3개 사기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:897
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Buy 1 Egg"
msgstr "달걀 1개 사기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:908
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys a red turret. The ultimate turret. Throw it and then see zombies get mowed down.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 빨간 포탑을 산다. 최강의 포탑이다. 던져 두면 좀비들이 쓸려 나간다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:909
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"No more zombie problems!\r\n"
"\tUntil the turret runs out of ammo..."
msgstr ""
"좀비 걱정 끝!\r\n"
"\t포탑의 탄약이 떨어질 때까지는..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:915
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys a green turret. Throw it on the ground and watch it go.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 초록 포탑을 산다. 바닥에 던져 놓고 활약을 구경하자.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:916
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "These can help a lot in a fight!"
msgstr "싸움에서 큰 도움이 될 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:921
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "What a Nerd"
msgstr "너드 중의 너드"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:923
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"This nerd is surrounded by beeping nerd doodads.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"삐삐거리는 너드 잡동사니에 둘러싸인 너드다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:924
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "I'm not a nerd! I have lots of interests! I go to sports bars!"
msgstr "난 너드 아니야! 관심사도 많고! 스포츠 바도 간다고!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:926
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The nerd has run out stock!"
msgstr "너드의 재고가 떨어졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:930
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"You can't afford anything. The nerd gives you a pukeyball as a consolation "
"prize."
msgstr "아무것도 살 수 없다. 너드가 위로의 선물로 퓨키볼을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:935
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Buy Green Turret - 6 food"
msgstr "초록 포탑 사기 - 식량 6"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:938
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Buy Red Turret - 12 food"
msgstr "빨간 포탑 사기 - 식량 12"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "Visit Trader Camp"
msgstr "상인 야영지 방문"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "Ignore Traders"
msgstr "상인들 무시하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid " runs into a trading camp!"
msgstr "은(는) 상인 야영지를 발견한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "Getting Closer to Canada"
msgstr "캐나다에 가까워지다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "Canada is close! This is the second to last chance to trade!"
msgstr "캐나다가 가깝다! 거래할 기회가 이제 두 번밖에 남지 않았다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "Last Shop Before Canada"
msgstr "캐나다 전 마지막 상점"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "This is the last chance to trade! Good luck!"
msgstr "거래할 마지막 기회다! 행운을 빈다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "Trading on the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드에서 거래하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid ""
"Outside of Canada, most of society and civilization has been destroyed. You "
"can still find people engaging in trade, with preserved food being the new "
"currency."
msgstr "캐나다 밖의 사회와 문명은 대부분 파괴됐다. 그래도 거래하는 사람들은 찾을 수 있다. 보존 식량이 새 화폐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid ""
" feels a sense of dread. Something dangerous is coming. The road seems like "
"it's getting steadily more crowded with the undead, and they're getting "
"riled up."
msgstr "은(는) 불길함을 느낀다. 위험한 것이 다가온다. 길은 점점 더 많은 언데드로 붐비고, 놈들은 갈수록 흥분한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid ""
"The drive to Canada used to take a few days, at most. The apocalypse filled "
"the roads with debris, hordes of zombies, and lots of stranded cars. It's "
"now a long trip."
msgstr "예전에는 캐나다까지 길어야 며칠이면 갔다. 종말 이후 도로는 잔해와 좀비 떼, 버려진 차로 가득 찼다. 이제는 긴 여정이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid ""
"The road trip continues. The sky starts to turn an ominous red, as if the "
"universe wants "
msgstr "여행은 계속된다. 하늘이 불길한 붉은빛으로 물든다. 우주가 바라기라도 하는 것 같다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid " to fail."
msgstr "의 실패를."

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid ""
"An enormous army of undead shambles around the carnage that surrounds the border to Canada. Many have tried to get through. Most only succeed in having their bodies added to the horde.\r\n"
"\t\tMaybe "
msgstr ""
"캐나다 국경 주변의 참혹한 현장에 거대한 언데드 군대가 어슬렁댄다. 많은 이들이 통과하려 했다. 대부분은 자기 몸을 좀비 떼에 보태는 데 그쳤다.\r\n"
"\t\t어쩌면 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid " will be different..."
msgstr "은(는) 다를지도..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "It's been a very long and winding road to Canada. "
msgstr "캐나다까지 오는 길은 정말 길고 구불구불했다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid " is now only a couple days away!"
msgstr "은(는) 이제 며칠만 더 가면 된다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:152
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid ""
"The end is in sight. At the end of this very long road is a massive amount of zombies, the natural end result of the hordes getting a little bigger every few days of travel.\r\n"
"\t\tMaybe "
msgstr ""
"끝이 보인다. 이 기나긴 길 끝에는 엄청난 수의 좀비가 있다. 며칠 이동할 때마다 조금씩 불어나던 무리가 결국 이렇게 된 것이다.\r\n"
"\t\t어쩌면 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid " can make it!"
msgstr "은(는) 해낼 수 있을지도!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid ""
" is driving down a long stretch of road. No threats on the horizon, but not "
"much else of interest, either. "
msgstr "은(는) 길게 뻗은 도로를 달린다. 저 멀리 위협은 보이지 않지만, 딱히 흥미로운 것도 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid ""
" continues making progress along the Death Road. As long as one person "
"remains alive, the dream of Canada lives on."
msgstr "은(는) 데스 로드에서 계속 전진한다. 한 사람이라도 살아 있는 한, 캐나다의 꿈도 살아 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid "Unexpectedly, "
msgstr "뜻밖에도 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid " finds someone "
msgstr "은(는) 거래할 만한 사람을 찾는다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/shuffler.df"
msgid " can trade with: "
msgstr "의 거래 상대: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid "The group"
msgstr "일행"

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid " is forced to flee the trader camp!"
msgstr "은(는) 상인 야영지에서 도망쳐야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid " knocks the man over, grabs a sack of food, and then runs. "
msgstr "은(는) 남자를 넘어뜨리고 식량 자루를 낚아채 달아난다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:21
#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:79
#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid " dragged into it."
msgstr "은(는) 거기에 휘말렸다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid " trades 25 units of gas for 2 food."
msgstr "은(는) 기름 25를 식량 2와 교환한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid " trades 50 units of gas for 4 food."
msgstr "은(는) 기름 50을 식량 4와 교환한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid " trades 100 units of gas for 8 food."
msgstr "은(는) 기름 100을 식량 8과 교환한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid "Gas to Snacks Conversion"
msgstr "기름을 간식으로"

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid " sees a man standing near an SUV."
msgstr "은(는) SUV 옆에 서 있는 남자를 본다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid ""
"Do you have any spare gas? I'm running out!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"남는 기름 있어? 곧 바닥날 것 같아서!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid "He offers to give you 2 cans of food for every 25 units of gas."
msgstr "기름 25마다 통조림 식량 2개를 주겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:50
#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:111
#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:171
#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:229
#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:286
#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:344
#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:491
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "괜찮아"

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid " robs him"
msgstr "은(는) 그를 턴다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/supplies.df"
msgid "Thanks for all the gas!"
